#. module: bike_leasing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_leasing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If the stock levels are too low, resupply the materials from the\n"
"                <strong>\n"
"                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Purchase</font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                app by creating a purchase order linked to the right vendor. "
"In the\n"
"                <strong>\n"
"                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Contact</font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                app, you can easily manage all your preferred vendors and "
"don't hesitate to set a warning to remind if there is a minimum amount to "
"get free transport costs."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງຕໍ່າເກີນໄປ, ໃຫ້ສັ່ງຊື້ວັດຖຸດິບເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກແອັບ\n"
"                <strong>\n"
"                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Purchase</font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                ໂດຍການສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຜູ້ສະໜອງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນແອັບ\n"
"                <strong>\n"
"                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Contact</font>\n"
"                </strong>,\n"
"                ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການຜູ້ສະໜອງຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ ແລະ ຢ່າລັງເລທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຈ້"
"ງເຕືອນເພື່ອເຕືອນຖ້າມີຍອດສັ່ງຊື້ຂັ້ນຕໍ່າເພື່ອໄດ້ຮັບການຂົນສົ່ງຟຣີ."

